{"id": "3326528", "name": "אינטגרלים כפולים – אליפסה והחלפת משתנים", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 2, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">אליפסה – שינוי משתנים</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div>יהי התחום</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 18px; margin: 8px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle D=\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb{R}^2\\mid \\frac{x^2-{{CT:0}}x+{{CT:1}}}{{{CT:2}}}+\\frac{y^2-{{CT:3}}y+{{CT:4}}}{{{CT:5}}}\\le1\\right\\}\\)</div>\n<div>חשבו</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 19px; margin: 8px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle I=\\iint_D\\left(\\frac{x^2-{{CT:0}}x+{{CT:1}}}{{{CT:2}}}+\\frac{y^2-{{CT:3}}y+{{CT:4}}}{{{CT:5}}}\\right)\\,dx\\,dy\\)</div>\n<div>השתמשו בהחלפה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle u=\\frac{x-{{CT:6}}}{{CT:7}},\\quad v=\\frac{y-{{CT:8}}}{{CT:9}}\\)</span>, ולאחר מכן בקואורדינטות קוטביות במישור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle u,v\\)</span>.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px;\">א. ההעתקה ההפוכה והיעקוביאן</div>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr)); gap: 10px; max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; align-items: start;\">\n<div style=\"background: #F8F7F9; border: 1px solid #E4DEE7; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 12px; min-width: 170px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 7px; white-space: nowrap;\">\\(\\displaystyle x(u,v)=\\)[[input:ans1]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #665f6b; margin-top: 4px;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #F8F7F9; border: 1px solid #E4DEE7; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 12px; min-width: 170px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 7px; white-space: nowrap;\">\\(\\displaystyle y(u,v)=\\)[[input:ans2]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #665f6b; margin-top: 4px;\">[[validation:ans2]]</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #F8F7F9; border: 1px solid #E4DEE7; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 12px; min-width: 170px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 7px; white-space: nowrap;\">\\(\\displaystyle J=\\)[[input:ans3]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #665f6b; margin-top: 4px;\">[[validation:ans3]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 8px;\">ב. התחום במישור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle u,v\\)</span></div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\\(\\displaystyle I=\\int_{\\theta_1}^{\\theta_2}\\int_{r_1(\\theta)}^{r_2(\\theta)}\\cdots\\,dr\\,d\\theta\\)</div>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(175px,1fr)); gap: 10px; max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; align-items: start;\">\n<div style=\"background: #F8F7F9; border: 1px solid #E4DEE7; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 12px; min-width: 170px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 7px; white-space: nowrap;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\theta_1=\\)[[input:ans4]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #665f6b; margin-top: 4px;\">[[validation:ans4]]</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #F8F7F9; border: 1px solid #E4DEE7; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 12px; min-width: 170px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 7px; white-space: nowrap;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\theta_2=\\)[[input:ans5]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #665f6b; margin-top: 4px;\">[[validation:ans5]]</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #F8F7F9; border: 1px solid #E4DEE7; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 12px; min-width: 170px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 7px; white-space: nowrap;\">\\(\\displaystyle r_1(\\theta)=\\)[[input:ans6]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #665f6b; margin-top: 4px;\">[[validation:ans6]]</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #F8F7F9; border: 1px solid #E4DEE7; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 12px; min-width: 170px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 7px; white-space: nowrap;\">\\(\\displaystyle r_2(\\theta)=\\)[[input:ans7]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #665f6b; margin-top: 4px;\">[[validation:ans7]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"max-width: 260px; margin: 10px auto 0;\">\n<div style=\"background: #F8F7F9; border: 1px solid #E4DEE7; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 12px; min-width: 170px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 7px; white-space: nowrap;\">\\(\\displaystyle I=\\)[[input:ans8]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #665f6b; margin-top: 4px;\">[[validation:ans8]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\